abstract: >
  Slurm JobMaker is an open-source, portable graphical tool for generating
  Slurm job submission scripts. It guides users through the configuration
  of key job parameters interactively and displays a live preview of the
  resulting script, reducing configuration errors and lowering the barrier
  for researchers new to HPC environments. Cluster-specific settings are
  loaded from plain-text profile files, making the tool portable across
  different HPC systems without recompilation.
